OL,3,GNEWSAFears of no compensation for
OL,4,Aflooded holiday park
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdministrators appointed for the
OL,7,Foperator of a holiday park site that
OL,8,Fflooded and shut over two years ago
OL,9,Fhave admitted it is "too early" to say
OL,10,Fwhether leaseholders previously offered
OL,11,Fcompensation will be paid.
OL,13,FMedmerry Holiday Park, near
OL,14,FBracklesham, West Sussex, closed after
OL,15,Fgale-force winds, rain and high tides
OL,16,Fflooded the park in April 2024.
OL,18,FIn September last year leaseholders
OL,19,Fwere offered compensation to terminate
OL,20,Ftheir leases early, by Medmerry Opco,
OL,21,Fwhich filed for administration on 9
OL,22,FSeptember this year.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
