OL,3,GNEWSAFears of no compensation for
OL,4,Aflooded holiday park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the joint
OL,7,Fadministrators, Adam Paxton and Robert
OL,8,FCroxen, said these claims "will be
OL,9,Fconsidered as part of the
OL,10,Fadministration process" but guarantees
OL,11,Fcannot be made.
